{"id":"c5ffa2a6c9f899dd","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-exponential-linear.md","title":"Exponential Linear Logic","display":"df-exponential-linear — Exponential Linear Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-exponential-linear","aliases":["72-df-exponential-linear"],"display":"df-exponential-linear — Exponential Linear Logic","depends_on":["[[72-df-linear-logic]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified","source_location":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf, Appendix B §§B.2–B.4 print151–158; independent one-sided finite-multiset encoding","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","proof_status":"local structural construction checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-exponential-linear"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-exponential-linear</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exponential-linear — Exponential Linear Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998; supplementary primary sources explicitly identified"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplement: Girard–Lafont–Taylor, Proofs and Types (1989), <a href=\"https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.paultaylor.eu/stable/prot.pdf</a>, Appendix B §§B.2–B.4 print151–158; independent one-sided finite-multiset encoding"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local structural construction checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-exponential-linear\">df-exponential-linear</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a70f24e0154f1736\" href=\"?note=a70f24e0154f1736\" title=\"72-df-linear-logic\">72-df-linear-logic</a> 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ELL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_{LL},R_0\\cup R_{cut}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{ELL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_{LL},R_0\\cup R_{cut}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>规则是有前提序列与结论的有序对集合，非一个没有定义的可导性谓词。片段语法由有限构造迭代给出；指数节点指完整命题LL中!/?规则层，不把一般结构规则加回非指数公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-exponential-linear","text":"df-exponential-linear","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-linear-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-linear-logic","status":"resolved","id":"a70f24e0154f1736","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-linear-logic]] 的公式、多重集和规则集合，所有规则实例均保留该定义的旁条件。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{ELL}:=\\langle\\mathcal F_{LL},R_0\\cup R_{cut}\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":1214,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-446","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-exponential-linear|df-exponential-linear — Exponential Linear Logic]]"}],"outgoing":["a70f24e0154f1736"]}